    },
    {
      "text": "A prong is a thin strip of metal rising from the setting,",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-front-white-render.webp",
        "label": "Prongs",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.25,
          "k": 1.8
        },
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.57,
            "y": 0.22,
            "text": "Prong",
            "at": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "then bends over the stone's edge to hold it in place.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "matthew-rose-render.webp",
        "label": "Over the edge",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.2,
          "k": 2.0
        },
        "marks": [
          {
            "x": 0.65,
            "y": 0.18,
            "text": "Bent over",
            "at": 0.5
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Four prongs show more of the stone and let more light in.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "photo",
        "src": "cad-render.webp",
        "label": "Four prongs",
        "focus": {
          "x": 0.4,
          "y": 0.12,
          "k": 1.6
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Six hold it more securely, which matters most for large stones.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "Six prongs",
        "sub": "For large stones"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiffany's six-prong setting, from 1886, lifts the diamond into the light.",
      "say": "Tiffany's six-prong setting, from eighteen eighty-six, lifts the diamond into the light.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "title",
        "text": "1886",
        "sub": "The Tiffany Setting"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The tips vary, from round to claws filed to a point.",
      "scene": {
        "kind": "steps",
        "items": [
